[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（２８３プロダクションに入社して数か月……\r\nいよいよ俺が、アイドルをプロデュースする時が来た）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "001"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ずっと憧れていた仕事をようやく任されたんだ、\r\nこれから精一杯頑張るぞ！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはようございます！\r\nって、天井社長……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "おはよう、お前を待っていたぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1902001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この２８３プロダクションを束ねる\r\n天井社長……あいかわらずダンディな雰囲気だ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "お前には今日から、アイドルを\r\nプロデュースしてもらうと伝えていたが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1902001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010030,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "素晴らしい結果を期待させてもらう\r\n私は甘くないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1902001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "は、はい！　よろしくお願いします！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010040,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "よろしい。では、仕事の説明ははづきに任せて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1902001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？　はづきさんはどこにも……あっ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そ、ソファの裏で誰かが倒れてる！？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "……ふわぁ～？\r\nなんですか～急に大きな声出して～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charType": "sub_characters",
    "charId": "staff",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1901001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010050,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "は、はづき……なぜ床で寝ているんだ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1902001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "すみません、ソファへ着く前に\r\n眠気に負けてしまいまして～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1901001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010060,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "せっかくまじめな雰囲気を出したというのに……",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1902001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010070,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……ともかく！\r\n彼に仕事の説明をしてくれ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1902001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい、もちろんです\r\nプロデューサーさん、どうぞ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1901001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\n……あいかわらず、わかりやすくまとまってますね、資料",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（はづきさん、こういうところは頼れるんだよな……）",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nそれじゃあ、さっそくお仕事の説明に入りますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1901001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "まず、今回のプロデュースの目標についてですが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1901001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ワンダーアイドルノヴァ・グランプリ……\r\n通称『W.I.N.G.』への出場を目指してください",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1901001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』……ですか",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい\r\n新人アイドルの祭典とも言われる、すごいライブなんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1901001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010080,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "祭典と言われるだけあって、この『W.I.N.G.』は\r\n出場資格を手に入れるまでが厳しいんです……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1901001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010090,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "エントリーしたアイドルは開催前まで、\r\n全４回のシーズンごとに審査を受けます",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1901001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010100,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "その時、一定のランクに達していないと、\r\n出場資格を失ってしまうんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1901001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010110,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ですので、精一杯頑張っていきましょ～！\r\n私もたくさんサポートさせていただきますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1901001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010080,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……少しアドバイスをしておくが、\r\nお前は、２８３プロダクションのプロデューサーだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1902001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010090,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "担当アイドルと他のアイドルたちを\r\n交流させることも重要になってくる",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1902001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010100,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "互いに影響しあうことで目指せる高みもあるだろう",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1902001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010110,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "まあ、まずは思うようにやってみるといい\r\n結果がついてくるかは、お前とアイドルの頑張り次第だ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1902001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010120,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "では、そろそろお仕事に移ってもらいましょうか\r\n今回プロデュースするアイドルは──",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1901001010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgEffect": "mask",
    "bg": "00003",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {},
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（自分でスカウトしてこい、か\r\nはづきさんも社長も、笑顔で無茶を言うよな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "015"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（人通りが多いこの辺りなら……と思ったけど\r\nなかなか良さそうな子は……ん？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010010,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "011",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1011001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あの子、なんだか他の子とは違う雰囲気を感じる\r\nひとりで歩いてるだけなのに不思議な風格があって……）",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まるで、孤高の狼みたいだな……）",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ねぇ君、ちょっといいかな？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1011001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ、ちょっと……\r\nそこの君、ちょっと待って！",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ん？　アタシか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1011001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだ。\r\n君のその髪なんだけど……",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はぁ？　なんだよアンタ\r\nアタシが髪染めてんのが気に入らね－ってのか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1011001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシがどうしようとアンタに関係ねぇだろ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1011001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、いや、そうじゃなくて\r\nむしろ、綺麗な色だなって思ってさ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "なっ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1011001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん。やっぱりよく似合ってるよ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "は、はあ……っ！？\r\nアンタ、いきなりなんなんだよ……？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1011001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、自己紹介が遅れてすまない\r\n実は俺、アイドルのプロデュ－サ－をやってるんだ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで、もしよかったら\r\n君をアイドルにスカウトしたくてさ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "スカウト……\r\nって、アタシをアイドルにしたいってことか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1011001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。さっき一目見てピ－ンと来て\r\n君なら絶対、すごいアイドルになれると思うんだ",
    "charLipAnim": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうだ？\r\n俺と一緒に、アイドルを目指してみないか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "い……いやいやいや！\r\nアタシがアイドルとか、冗談だろ！？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1011001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……つかテメ－。ひょっとして\r\nアタシのことからかってんじゃね－だろな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1011001010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へ……？\r\nからかってるって、なんのことだ？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そんなの決まってんだろ\r\nアタシがアイドルってガラに見えんのかよ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1011001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "この髪に、格好だって女っぽくね－し\r\n口だってこの通り、いい方じゃね－……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1011001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010130,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "これでアイドルに向いてるって言われて\r\n信用しろって方が無理があんだろ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1011001010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことない。雰囲気や喋り方は、ひとつの個性\r\nむしろアイドルとして魅力的だよ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010140,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ふぅん……魅力、ね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100101/1011001010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（黙り込んでしまった……\r\n一気にたくさん話しすぎて、引かれてしまったかな）",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLipAnim": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001010150,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……西城樹里だ。樹里って呼べよ",
